{"3831510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Five Nights At Stickman", "steam_appid": 3831510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Stickman’s Bistro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Nights at Stickman</strong> is a 2D indie horror game inspired by the original FNAF formula. As the new night guard at a stick-figure-themed restaurant, your job is simple: make it through the night without getting… <i>visited</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the security cameras. Shut the doors. Conserve power. And whatever you do — don’t let them in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic FNAF-style gameplay</strong> – Survive 6 increasingly difficult nights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Night mode</strong> – Set your own challenge and test your nerves </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point-and-click survival</strong> – Monitor the building, manage your power, and stay alert</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro 2D stickman horror vibe</strong> – Simple visuals, big scares</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is about 1 hour and 12 minutes long for all 6 nights minus the custom night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Every previous version is accessible through Steam. For access, go to game page in library, gear icon, properties, and then game versions&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with: GDevelop 5</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Stickman’s Bistro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Nights at Stickman</strong> is a 2D indie horror game inspired by the original FNAF formula. As the new night guard at a stick-figure-themed restaurant, your job is simple: make it through the night without getting… <i>visited</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the security cameras. Shut the doors. Conserve power. And whatever you do — don’t let them in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic FNAF-style gameplay</strong> – Survive 6 increasingly difficult nights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Night mode</strong> – Set your own challenge and test your nerves </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point-and-click survival</strong> – Monitor the building, manage your power, and stay alert</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro 2D stickman horror vibe</strong> – Simple visuals, big scares</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is about 1 hour and 12 minutes long for all 6 nights minus the custom night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Every previous version is accessible through Steam. For access, go to game page in library, gear icon, properties, and then game versions&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with: GDevelop 5</p>", "short_description": "Survive five nights at Stickman’s Bistro! Monitor cameras, conserve power, and outwit restless stickman in this classic-style point-and-click horror game. Includes 5 nights, a 6th night, Custom Night, and 3 unique endings!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831510/9a102417aa7e400b84261f5177e17e2d3754ff9b/header.jpg?t=1781612349", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831510/be713b33e9418b4be2e87ba035b6badb5f84e93d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781612349", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.